  {
    "id": "71fd5125d043",
    "text": "I hang his tiny coat up.\nCrumbs sit on the afternoon plate.\nHe climbs to reach the hook now.\nOne day the coat hangs empty.\nThe plate stays clean too long.\nI touch the hook, hands still.\nI leave the coat right there.\nI set his plate out anyway.\nI watch him outgrow the hook.",
